<title>AUSTRIA: ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WOMEN'S WORLD CUP GIANT SLALOM FIRST LEG TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>SOELDEN, Austria 1996-10-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading first leg times in a women's Alpine skiing World Cup giant slalom on Saturday:</p>
<p>1. Deborah Compagnoni (Italy) one minute 04.59 seconds</p>
<p>2. Katja Seizinger (Germany) 1:04.73</p>
<p>3. Karin Roten (Switzerland)1:05.31</p>
<p>4. Hilde Gerg (Germany) 1:05.83</p>
<p>5. Anita Wachter (Austria) 1:06.31</p>
<p>6. Ana Galindo Santolaria (Spain) 1:06.34</p>
<p>7. Andrine Flemmen (Norway) 1:06.44</p>
<p>8. Alexandra Meissnitzer (Austria) 1:06.55</p>
<p>9. Erika Hansson (Sweden) 1:06.95</p>
<p>10. Urska Hrovat (Slovenia) 1:07.04</p>
</text>
